  "id": "subfecundity",
  "term": "subfecundity",
  "definition": "Subfecundity means reduced ability to conceive, shown by taking longer than 12 months to become pregnant despite having unprotected sexual intercourse. It can also bring psychological, social, and economic effects for couples.",
